  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Loans aren''t free money. A loan is money you borrow that you must pay
    back, usually with interest (the cost of borrowing the money). You''ll have a
    set repayment schedule, so you need to be sure your business can generate enough
    cash flow to cover the monthly payments.


    Your personal finances matter.
    Even though the loan is for your business, lenders will heavily evaluate your
    personal credit score and financial history to determine your creditworthiness.
    A good credit score and history show you''re responsible with money and can increase
    your chances of approval and getting better loan terms.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6e6891c03f13f1e44a213bc615ab5855, type: 2}
